# Workspace-aware globs: a bare `node_modules` only matches the root copy, which
# would leak apps/web/node_modules and packages/*/node_modules into the build context.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
.git
.env*
!.env.example
coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
graphify-out
design
*.md
!README.md
Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
deploy/backup.sh
